Package: frbaremekm
Type: Package
Title: French Tax Mileage Allowance Scale ('Bareme Kilometrique')
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rédaction MaCalculatrice", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "contact@macalculatriceenligne.com"),
    person("MaCalculatriceEnLigne", role = "cph"))
Description: The French tax mileage allowance scale ('bareme kilometrique')
    used to deduct professional travel costs ('frais reels') from French
    income tax: tax returns 2022 to 2026 (income years 2021 to 2025), cars,
    motorcycles and mopeds, 135 rates, with the 20 % increase for 100 %
    electric vehicles. Port of the Go package 'baremekm' published by
    MaCalculatriceEnLigne; no dependency.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tresor4k/fr-bareme-km-r,
    https://macalculatriceenligne.com/finance/divers/calcul-frais-kilometriques/
BugReports: https://github.com/tresor4k/fr-bareme-km-r/issues
Language: en-US
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
